From: Omer Katz <omerkatz@chromium.org>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 10:12:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [M156] [cppgc] Update the Steele-style barrier to always retrace

Original change's description:
> [cppgc] Update the Steele-style barrier to always retrace
>
> The barrier retraced objects only if they were already marked. This
> doesn't work well with concurrent marking because the object could be
> marked and the main thread hasn't observed it yet. Instead change the
> barrier to mark regardless of whether the object was already marked.
>
